petrus-fabric
Copyright 2026 Seasoned

This package is an independent Haskell implementation that reproduces the
observable behaviour of the pinned Petrus Python reference (see UPSTREAM.md
at the repository root). Its schema text, SQL statements, wire format,
identity derivations and error messages are reproduced from that reference
so that both implementations share one PostgreSQL database and exchange
each other's envelopes. The acceptance demo reproduces the reference's
scripts/cv5-fabric-demo.py. The driver scripts in test/interop and bench run
the reference itself from the pinned upstream virtual environment.

